# Vendored submodules not needed for the common install + the ACT and
# diffusion-policy extras baked into the image. Note third_party/diffusion_policy
# is deliberately NOT listed here: the policy module imports it directly off
# the filesystem, so it has to stay in the build context. Everything below is
# still available at runtime via the docker-compose bind mount, for manual
# installation of the remaining policy extras.
